# DS-0002 "Image user should not be root": the Apache parent process starts as root to bind
# port 80 and prepare the upload volumes (entrypoint.sh); request-handling workers run as
# www-data. Revisit if the app moves to a non-root port behind the host proxy.
DS-0002
